00:18:33.783 --> 00:18:38.455
The greedy feed even locked onto whatever old products it happened to show first.

338
00:18:38.735 --> 00:18:46.116
Thompson sampling (or UCB) explores in proportion to uncertainty and stops exploring once evidence arrives.

339
00:18:46.396 --> 00:18:50.641
Reserved slots work for the specific case of new launches, and nothing else.

340
00:18:50.921 --> 00:18:57.919
