351
00:20:02.171 --> 00:20:11.409
Batch: daily training sets with point-in-time features, model training, co-purchase matrices, per-user candidate lists (Ch 21).

352
00:20:11.689 --> 00:20:19.582
Streaming: recent purchases and cart events update user times item features within minutes; stock changes within seconds.

353
00:20:19.862 --> 00:20:24.961
Model registry and rollout: versioned models, shadow scoring, canary, rollback.

354
00:20:26.311 --> 00:20:27.441
