00:22:49.078 --> 00:23:01.921
Context, v1 feed: buy-again dominated, self-reinforcing position bias, no exposure for new products, out-of-stock items from nightly features, 800 feature calls per request.

401
00:23:02.201 --> 00:23:22.595
Decision, Multi-source retrieval with explicit quotas; ranker trained with position debiasing on propensity-logged impressions; online feature store with batched reads and live stock; Thompson-sampling exploration slot per carousel plus a new-arrivals carousel; hybrid precompute; guardrails and A or B testing.

402
00:23:23.945 --> 00:23:42.143
Related ADRs, ADR-290 Retriever quotas per carousel, reviewed monthly (L1); ADR-291 Log position, source and propensity for every impression; position-aware training (L2); ADR-292 Feature store:

403
00:23:42.423 --> 00:24:14.416
Redis online, one MGET or HMGET per request, item cache 30 s, stock never cached (L3); ADR-293 Exploration: one Thompson slot per carousel, new-arrivals carousel for 14 days (L4); ADR-294 Hybrid serving: nightly candidates, online ranking; fallback to last good feed; ADR-295 Guardrails: zero out-of-stock impressions, diversity caps, p99 150 ms.

