Score 400 candidates per request inside a 150 ms budget, with correct stock.

504
00:33:10.995 --> 00:33:16.329
A real Redis holds 60,000 item-store keys and 2,000 customer hashes.

505
00:33:16.609 --> 00:33:24.075
A writer thread changes stock for 2% of items per second while four fetch strategies each serve 500 requests.

