00:35:05.417 --> 00:35:24.233
(p50 or p99 are real localhost timings and vary by machine; the 0.5 ms column adds a. typical cross-AZ round trip. per trip to the measured p50, an estimate.). then the cost of features is round trips, not bytes: hundreds of tiny GETs cost far.

